            [2, 2, 2],
            [3, 3, 3]],
           [[4, 4, 4],
            [5, 5, 5],
            [6, 6, 6]]], dtype=int32)>

  Args:
    tensor: A `Tensor`.
    shape: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `int32`, `int64`.
      Defines the shape of the output tensor.
    name: Optional string. A name for the operation.

  Returns:
    A `Tensor`. Has the same type as `tensor`.

